    "ruleType": "enhancement",
    "group": "Ritual of Regeneration",
    "summary": "For a THOUSAND SONS PSYKER model that is INFANTRY or MOUNTED (35 points). Once per battle for your army, when the bearer is destroyed, roll a D6 at the end of that phase. On a 2+, return the bearer to the battlefield unengaged, placing it as close as it can go to the spot of its destruction; it has 3 wounds remaining. It returns as a unit of its own, not part of any attached unit, and that unit's Starting Strength is 1.",
